irmare accordi sull\'interoperabilit� digitale attraverso la piattaforma;- autenticare e autorizzare l\'accesso alle API utilizzando le funzionalit� della piattaforma;- convalidare e valutare la conformit� al quadro nazionale in materia di interoperabilit�',NULL,'Piattaforma Digitale Nazionale Dati operativa','Q4','2022'),('M1C1-40','Complete the recruitme nt procedure s for administra tive courts by putting into service at least 326 units of personnel.\n The baseline shall be the\n number of personnel in service on 31 December 2021. The\n completed staffing procedure s should not include those funded through national funds. For completed staffing procedure s it is meant the contract signed and the personnel\n in service.','Report on the completion of additional staffing procedures accompanied by a document duly justifying how the target, including all the constitutive elements, was satisfactorily fulfilled. List of  anonymized contracts indicating the identification number of the units of  personnel recruited and placed into service','UE',NULL,NULL,'Conclusione delle procedure di assunzione per i tribunali amministrativi','Q2','2024'),('M1C1-41','The baseline for the reduction of backlog cases for Administrative Regional Courts is 109.209 pending cases at the end of 2019.','Statistics of Italian Council of State accompanied by a document duly justifying how the target, including all the constitutive elements, was satisfactorily fulfilled.','UE',NULL,NULL,'Riduzione dell\'arretrato giudiziario dei tribunali amministrativi regionali','Q2','2024'),('M1C1-41-ITA-1',NULL,NULL,'ITA',NULL,NULL,'Numero di ricorsi iscritti a ruolo entro il 31 dicembre 2019 ancora pendenti dinanzi ai tribunali amministrativi regionali (tribunali amministrativi di primo grado)','Q2','2024'),('M1C1-42','The baseline for the reduction of backlog cases for the Council of State is 24.010\n pending cases at the end of\n 2019.','Report prepared by the Statistics of Italian Council of State accompan